{"qid": 499, "answered": "true_answer", "resp": "A reward delivered after a set number of responses (ten purchases) is a fixed-ratio schedule, since reinforcement depends on a fixed count of behaviors rather than time.\n\nFINAL: Fixed-ratio", "final": "Fixed-ratio"}
